# Chat UI in front of Eliza, without the context/BDI loop.
#
# ChatUiService refuses to post an utterance until it has seen a ScenarioStarted
# event (_create_payload raises ValueError on a null scenario_id), so the test
# publishes one itself via cltl_integration.drivers.scenario. That keeps this a
# two-module slice instead of dragging in cltl-context.
